Noise octaves. 1 is a slow drift, higher adds sharper twitches on top.	噪声倍频数。1 为缓慢漂移，更高会叠加更尖锐的抖动。
Sends a different body yaw for one frame and restores it. The turn never renders locally.	为一帧发送不同的身体偏航并随后恢复。该转向不会在本地渲染。
Backwards and Sideways hold a fixed turn. Spin, Sway and Jitter move over time. Random rerolls every tick.	向后和侧向保持固定转向。旋转、摇摆和抖动随时间变化。随机模式每个周期重新随机。
Shapes Spin and Sway. Linear is constant speed, the rest slow down at the edges.	影响旋转和摇摆。线性为匀速，其余在两端减速。
Width used by Sway and Jitter.	摇摆和抖动使用的宽度。
Holds a game animation while the desync runs so the offset reads as movement instead of a position jump.	在不同步运行期间保持游戏动画，使偏移看起来像移动而不是位置跳变。
Hide Body and Invis reuse the poses those features already play. Custom takes the id below.	隐藏身体和隐身复用这些功能已播放的姿势。自定义使用下方的 ID。
Holds the animation at this timestamp. Zero lets it play through instead.	将动画保持在此时间点。为零则让动画正常播放。
Added on top of whatever the method produces.	叠加在该方式产生的结果之上。
Hide Head sinks the head into the torso and stops your look angle from replicating.	隐藏头部会把头沉入躯干，并阻止你的视角角度被复制。
Toggles the selected head mode on/off.	开启或关闭所选的头部模式。
Animation ID for Custom Anim.	自定义动画的动画 ID。
Animation freeze position (% of its length).	动画冻结位置（占其长度的百分比）。
Neck angle for Custom Yaw.	自定义偏航的颈部角度。
Arm angle comes from one vertical value, so these modes push it past its limits.	手臂角度来自单一的垂直值，因此这些模式会使其超出限制。
Applies Arms Mode to your shoulders, so the arm hitboxes move with it.	将手臂模式应用到你的肩部，使手臂判定框随之移动。
Overrides the crouch flag that goes out with your movement.	覆盖随你的移动一起发送的蹲下标记。
Same idea for the sprint flag.	冲刺标记同理。
Replaces the movement speed you report.	替换你上报的移动速度。
0 reports standing still, which mutes the steps others hear. Values above 50 stop getting louder because of their own cap.	0 表示上报为静止，这会让他人听不到脚步声。大于 50 的值因自身上限不会再变大声。
While the target is airborne the vertical aim stays put, then flicks back after a pause.	目标在空中时垂直瞄准保持不动，停顿后再甩回。
What ends the hold: the target landing, or a fixed time in the air.	决定何时结束保持：目标落地，或在空中经过固定时间。
Air time before the release, used by After Delay only.	释放前的空中时间，仅用于延迟后释放。
The wait is picked at random between min and max on every jump.	每次跳跃时，等待时间会在最小值与最大值之间随机选取。
The flick length is picked at random between min and max, lower is sharper.	甩枪时长在最小值与最大值之间随机选取，越小越锐利。
Swings the equipped melee at the nearest valid target in range.	对范围内最近的有效目标挥动手持近战武器。
Minimum gap between swings.	两次挥击之间的最短间隔。
Ignores targets at or below this health, so the aura does not waste swings on someone already going down.	忽略生命值不高于此值的目标，避免光环把挥击浪费在已经倒下的人身上。
Registers melee hits on the chosen hitbox instead of the part you actually hit.	把近战命中登记在选定的判定框上，而不是你实际击中的部位。
Take over rockets and C4 in flight, fly them with WASD and the mouse	接管飞行中的火箭和 C4，用 WASD 和鼠标操控飞行
Warp the round onto the closest target the moment it is taken over	接管后立即将弹体传送到最近的目标
Reports why a teleport did or did not happen. Turn it on when the round refuses to warp	报告传送发生或未发生的原因。弹体拒绝传送时请开启
Only targets players marked as Enemy in the player list.	仅以玩家列表中标记为敌人的玩家为目标。
Crosshair takes whoever sits closest to your aim. Nearest ignores aim and takes the closest player.	准星模式选择离你瞄准点最近的目标。最近模式忽略瞄准，直接选择最近的玩家。
How far from the crosshair a target may sit in Crosshair mode. Lower values make the pick more deliberate	准星模式下目标可以离准星多远。数值越小，选择越谨慎
Ignores targets farther than this.	忽略比此值更远的目标。
Detonate C4 automatically instead of waiting for a click	自动引爆 C4，而不是等待点击
Lets rounds pass through the map. Turn it off to actually hit players	让弹体穿过地图。关闭后才能真正击中玩家
Where the round is placed on the target.	弹体落在目标的哪个位置。
How far behind the target rockets are dropped so they still collide	火箭落在目标身后多远，仍能产生碰撞
Automatically refills ammo near a compatible store.	在兼容的商店附近自动补充弹药。
Automatically buys the selected item near a store.	在商店附近自动购买所选物品。
R6 only. Drops the character flat for one frame each tick so the pose replicates, no animation is played.	仅限 R6。每个周期让角色平躺一帧以复制姿势，不播放动画。
Requires both target HP loss and the game's HitmarkerSound before drawing hit chams.	绘制命中染色前，要求目标生命值减少且游戏触发 HitmarkerSound。
Total hit-chams lifetime. 125 = 1.25 seconds.	命中染色的总存活时间。125 = 1.25 秒。
Maximum number of hit-chams snapshots visible at the same time. Oldest snapshots are removed first.	同时可见的命中染色快照最大数量。最旧的快照最先移除。
Smoothly fade the frozen pose.	平滑淡出冻结的姿势。
Time kept at the selected alpha before fading. 10 = 0.10 seconds.	淡出前保持在所选透明度的时间。10 = 0.10 秒。
Automatically selects a valid target and fires when a configured path is available.	自动选择有效目标，并在存在已配置路径时开火。
On Empty reloads like a normal player. Spam asks the server for ammo every 100 ms.	空弹时像普通玩家一样换弹。刷屏每 100 毫秒向服务器请求弹药。
R6 bones the scan may aim at.	扫描可以瞄准的 R6 骨骼。
How the scan budget is split across the selected hitboxes.	扫描预算如何在所选命中部位之间分配。
Sticks to the current target instead of re-picking one every frame.	保持当前目标，而不是每帧重新选择。
How much better a rival must rank before it steals focus from the current target.	竞争目标的排名需要高出多少才能夺走当前目标的焦点。
Chooses targets by screen distance, world distance, or lowest current health after all filters are applied.	应用所有过滤条件后，按屏幕距离、世界距离或当前最低生命值选择目标。
Completely excludes targets farther than this distance before target sorting and path finding.	在目标排序和寻路之前，完全排除比此距离更远的目标。
Spectates the player selected by the configured Spectate Mode.	观战由观战模式配置所选的玩家。
Follows the Ragebot target, the nearest Enemy, or your player list pick.	跟随暴力自瞄目标、最近的敌人，或你在玩家列表中选择的玩家。
Draws a line from the cursor to the current Ragebot target.	从光标到当前暴力自瞄目标绘制一条线。
Controls the delay between shot start and hit confirmation.	控制射击开始到命中确认之间的延迟。
Paces shots at the exact rate the weapon fires at, which looks like normal shooting.	按武器的精确射速射击，看起来像正常射击。
Face and UV coordinate reported with every hit.	随每次命中上报的表面与 UV 坐标。
Notifies on every confirmed hit with the damage dealt and which Path Finding method landed it.	每次确认命中时通知，并显示造成的伤害和命中的寻路方式。
Appends the scan type that found the path.	附加发现该路径的扫描类型。
Marks whether the path came from the cache or was scanned fresh.	标注路径来自缓存还是新扫描。
Fires the equipped tool hitmarker after a confirmed Ragebot shot.	暴力自瞄确认命中后触发手持工具的命中标记。
Restricts automatic target selection to the configured screen radius.	将自动目标选择限制在配置的屏幕半径内。
Displays the target-selection radius around the cursor.	在光标周围显示目标选择半径。
Sets the maximum screen-space distance for target selection.	设置目标选择的最大屏幕空间距离。
Ignores targets whose humanoid has no health.	忽略 Humanoid 没有生命值的目标。
Ignores targets marked as downed by the game.	忽略被游戏标记为倒地的目标。
Ignores players on the same Roblox team.	忽略处于同一 Roblox 队伍的玩家。
Ignores targets protected by a ForceField.	忽略受力场保护的目标。
Point patterns used to search for a clear line. Each enabled type gets its own candidate budget.	用于寻找通畅视线的点位模式。每种启用的类型都有独立的候选预算。
Maximum origin shift used by Path Finding methods.	寻路方式使用的最大起点偏移。
Target-side shift; after the update the server rejects hits more than 3-4 st from the part.	目标侧偏移；更新后服务器会拒绝距离部件超过 3-4 st 的命中。
Origin-side point count. Fixed and Bounce use their source fixed patterns and ignore this.	起点侧点数。固定和弹跳使用其自带的固定模式，忽略此项。
Target-side point count. Applies to every Scan Type except Fixed, which uses its source fixed pattern.	目标侧点数。适用于除固定以外的所有扫描类型，固定使用其自带的固定模式。
Path-check budget per enabled Scan Type. 2 types can scan up to 2x this amount, 3 types up to 3x, etc.	每种启用的扫描类型的路径检查预算。2 种类型最多扫描此值的 2 倍，3 种最多 3 倍，依此类推。
Accepts a blocked line if the gap to the target is under this value.	如果与目标之间的间隙小于此值，则接受被阻挡的视线。
Leftover distance the server tolerates.	服务器容忍的剩余距离。
Adds the target's own speed to the slack, exactly like the server does.	把目标自身的速度加入容差，与服务器的做法完全一致。
Ignores the same parts the server ignores when it checks a hit.	忽略服务器在检查命中时忽略的相同部件。
When no clear line exists, shoots the least blocked one if the cover measures thin enough.	没有通畅视线时，如果掩体足够薄，则对阻挡最少的路径射击。
Maximum total cover thickness a wallbang shot may pass through.	穿墙射击可穿过的掩体总厚度上限。
Maximum number of separate parts a wallbang shot may pass through.	穿墙射击可穿过的独立部件数量上限。
Records every wallbang shot and whether it dealt damage, per weapon and cover material.	按武器和掩体材质记录每次穿墙射击以及是否造成伤害。
Uses the learned thickness limit for the held weapon and cover material instead of the slider.	使用所持武器和掩体材质的已学习厚度上限，而不是滑块值。
Clears every learned bucket and the recorded samples.	清除所有已学习的分组和已记录的样本。
Hard ceiling on path checks shared by every target per scan. Targets left over resume on the next scan.	每次扫描中所有目标共享的路径检查硬上限。剩余目标在下次扫描继续。
Keeps the origin and hit point of past shots on a target and retries them before running a fresh scan.	保存对目标过去射击的起点和命中点，并在新扫描前重试。
How many past shots to keep per target. Newest first, older pairs drop off the end.	每个目标保留多少次过去的射击。最新的在前，较旧的组合会被丢弃。
How far you and the target may drift before a remembered pair is considered stale.	你与目标漂移多远后，记住的组合会被视为过期。
Aims where the target will be when the packet lands, not where it is now.	瞄准数据包到达时目标将在的位置，而不是它现在的位置。
100% leads by exactly your ping. Lower it if shots land in front of the target, raise it if they trail behind.	100% 恰好按你的延迟提前。射击落在目标前方时调低，落在目标后方时调高。
Drops a remembered path after this many shots went through it and forces a fresh scan.	在一条记住的路径被使用这么多次后丢弃它，并强制重新扫描。
Path Finding refresh rate: 5% = 3 Hz, 40% = 24 Hz, 100% = 60 Hz.	寻路刷新率：5% = 3 Hz，40% = 24 Hz，100% = 60 Hz。
A scan that does not fit continues next frame, so a big Ray Budget no longer drops fps.	放不下的扫描会在下一帧继续，因此较大的射线预算不再降低帧率。
Trail uses Camera.Bullets and preserves the real curved projectile path.	轨迹使用 Camera.Bullets，并保留真实的弹道曲线。
Shows the MolotovExplosion hitbox/radius through walls.	透过墙体显示 MolotovExplosion 的判定框/半径。
Shows only players manually marked Enemy in the Player List.	仅显示在玩家列表中手动标记为敌人的玩家。
0 = every frame. Set it below your actual frame rate or it does nothing.	0 = 每帧。请设置得低于你的实际帧率，否则无效。
Skips all drawing work for targets past this range. 0 = no limit.	对超出此范围的目标跳过所有绘制工作。0 = 不限制。
Renders box, names, distance, weapon, bars and flags with Drawing instead of GUI frames. Gradients and team/friendly tags are dropped	使用 Drawing 而不是 GUI 框体来渲染方框、名称、距离、武器、条和标记。渐变与队伍/友军标签将被省略
Big FPS win. Turn off only if box edges look slightly loose	大幅提升帧率。仅当方框边缘看起来略微松散时才关闭
Flags players once a known exploit animation is seen. Stays for the session.	一旦发现已知的作弊动画就标记该玩家。在本次会话中保持。
Highlight is the cheapest. MeshChams looks best but rebuilds shells on respawn	高亮开销最低。网格染色效果最好，但会在重生时重建外壳
How many studs / 100 the visible layer is larger than the invisible layer.	可见层比不可见层大多少 stud / 100。
Uses a correctly oriented CylinderHandleAdornment for the head.	为头部使用方向正确的 CylinderHandleAdornment。
Width of the round R6 head relative to the original cylinder size.	圆形 R6 头部相对于原始圆柱体大小的宽度。
Slightly enlarges the copied geometry to prevent z-fighting.	略微放大复制的几何体以防止 Z 轴冲突。
Includes accessory Handles, MeshParts and SpecialMeshes.	包含配饰的 Handle、MeshPart 和 SpecialMesh。
Keeps MeshPart, SpecialMesh, decal and SurfaceAppearance textures.	保留 MeshPart、SpecialMesh、贴花和 SurfaceAppearance 的纹理。
Overrides Disable On Aim while aiming.	瞄准时覆盖「瞄准时禁用」。
Continuously rotates the custom skybox around the vertical axis.	持续围绕垂直轴旋转自定义天空盒。
Sets how fast the custom skybox rotates.	设置自定义天空盒的旋转速度。
Draws a magazine bar with the live round count. Reads the same values the game HUD does.	绘制带有实时子弹数的弹匣条。读取的数值与游戏界面相同。
Magazine pins the bar to your magazine, otherwise it sits in the center.	弹匣模式把条固定在你的弹匣上，否则位于屏幕中央。
On, the bar runs from the low colour to the high colour across its own length.	开启时，条在自身长度上从低色渐变到高色。
Appends the spare ammo you carry in brackets.	在括号中附加你携带的备用弹药。
http(s) is detected as a raw URL. Every other value is treated as an executor workspace path.	http(s) 会被识别为原始链接。其他任何值都视为执行器的工作区路径。
Marks players in the player list when they play a known cheat animation.	当玩家播放已知的作弊动画时，在玩家列表中标记该玩家。
Blocks every feature marked with a warning: ragebot, desync, fly, noclip, invisible.	阻止所有带警告标记的功能：暴力自瞄、不同步、飞行、穿墙、隐身。
